  - scientific software

abstract: >
  Noetiko Convergence is a reproducibility-focused toolkit accompanying the
  Noetiko Convergence paper trilogy (Papers I–III). It provides reference
  implementations and validation utilities for phase-based analysis, admissibility
  gates, surrogate controls, coordination metrics, and related numerical
  procedures designed for reproducible scientific workflows.

